"On certain ESCs DShot commands are supported. These allow functions such as "
"ESC LEDs, beeps and motor direction to be manipulated by the autopilot. In "
"order to use DShot commands:"
msgstr "某些电调支持 DShot 指令。这些指令允许飞控控制电调的 LED 灯、蜂鸣器和电机方向等功能。使用 DShot 指令需要："

#: ../../source/docs/common-dshot-escs.rst:99 b67ddae5b93c4b1fac2421541281bdde
